# LICENCE — `WP/`

This file declares the licence terms for the `WP/` directory, in line with the
repository's **split-licence architecture** (root [`LICENCE`](../LICENCE), T(h)reehouse +EC
Corporate Design rule CD 0.3, and Design Principle 12 of
[`WORKPLAN_v0.3.md`](../WORKPLAN_v0.3.md)). It mirrors the per-folder declaration
pattern of [`docs/LICENCE`](../docs/LICENCE) and [`assets/LICENCE`](../assets/LICENCE).

## Terms

All material in `WP/` is **project-governance / planning material on the Coastline
track**, licensed **CC BY-SA 4.0** (`SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0`),
consistent with the root-level Coastline documents `WORKPLAN_v0.3.md` and
`CONVENTIONS.md`.

| Path | Layer | Licence | SPDX |
|---|---|---|---|
| `WP/README.md`, `WP/TEMPLATE.md`, `WP/LOGBOOK.md` | WP framework (governance) | CC BY-SA 4.0 | `CC-BY-SA-4.0` |
| `WP/WP-NN-*.md` | Per-card execution plans | CC BY-SA 4.0 | `CC-BY-SA-4.0` |
| `WP/FAIR.md` and other thematic side-cars | Planning side-cars | CC BY-SA 4.0 | `CC-BY-SA-4.0` |
| `WP/REVIEW_LOG.md` and other review notes | Review records | CC BY-SA 4.0 | `CC-BY-SA-4.0` |

## Coastline / Sail tags vs the folder licence

WP documents carry inline `*(Sail)*` / `*(Coastline)*` / `*(Coastline gate)*`
section tags (CD 0.9). These mark which **lines** are revisable guidance versus
binding gates **within** a document; they do **not** change the folder licence.
The whole folder is CC BY-SA 4.0 because it is project-governance material — the
same rationale under which `WORKPLAN_v0.3.md` is Coastline despite being a plan.

Code, tests, and tooling that a WP *plans* are **not** governed by this file:
they land under their own layer's licence per the root split (MIT for `src/`,
`tests/`, `tools/`, `.github/`; CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for Sail tutorials under
`docs/tutorials/`). A WP document is the plan; the deliverable carries its own
SPDX header.

## Pending ratification — root `LICENCE` table

The root [`LICENCE`](../LICENCE) "Summary of layers" table does not yet list
`WP/` or `task cards/`. Until the maintainer ratifies the addition, this
per-folder file is authoritative for `WP/`. The proposed root rows are:

| Path | Layer | Licence | SPDX |
|---|---|---|---|
| `WP/` | WP framework, plans, logbook, side-cars (governance) | CC BY-SA 4.0 | `CC-BY-SA-4.0` |
| `task cards/` | Incoming briefs (external handoffs) | per each card's own declaration | — |

(`task cards/` content is authored upstream and arrives with its own status /
endorsement language; it is not relicensed at the boundary. Each card states its
own terms — see the card header.)

